[01:55] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'added. Close-up now is obviously much closer from the ref sheet. &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; Finally, prompt relay disabled. Only a'

[02:12] [scene:talk]
